\label{lemma:Ek-Fourier}
The Eisenstein series possesses the Fourier expansion
\begin{equation}\label{eqn:Ek-Fourier}E_k(z)=1+\frac{2}{\zeta(1-k)}\sum_{n=1}^\infty \sigma_{k-1}(n)\,e^{2\pi i z}, \end{equation}
