    = \Delta (7200 (-E_{2}') G + 640 H_2 F) > 0.
\end{align}
Hence $\mathcal{L}_{1, 0}(it) > 0$ by Theorem \ref{thm:anti-serre-der-pos}, and the monotonicity follows.

